    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"How was it?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Honestly?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"It was much more pleasant than I expected"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"You picked a really good person"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"We spent most of the time talking"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"And in the end I agreed to stay for two hours instead of one"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"I'm glad everything went well"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"You sounded really nervous this morning"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"I was"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"But after a few minutes it felt completely natural"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"He was polite and easy to talk to"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"That's exactly what I was hoping for"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"If that's what the job is like every day, I think I'll be very happy"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Remember, you're the one who decides where things go"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"You can take things at whatever pace you want"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"And you'll probably get to meet a lot of interesting people"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"I think that's part of what I enjoyed"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"It felt good to have some interaction outside the house again"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"And to take a little time for myself"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"I didn't realize how much I missed that"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Then it sounds like a success to me"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"I think so too 😊"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Thank you for helping me take the first step"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Anytime"},
